<body>
    <h1>OSS IDs assignment for Compass X users with trading access</h1>
    <div class=3D"Section1">
        <h1 id=3D"OSSIDsassignmentforCompassXuserswithtradingaccess-Overvie=
w">Overview</h1>
<p>For setting up a Compass X user with trading access, providing the OSS I=
Ds are <strong>mandatory</strong>.</p>
<p>There are<strong> 2 OSS IDs</strong> linked to a compass X user and they=
 are used for different purposes.&nbsp; &nbsp;</p>
<ul>
 <li><strong>OSS User ID</strong> - used when creating. updating or canceli=
ng the order in OSS (<strong>except mutual fund orders</strong>).&nbsp; &nb=
sp; OSS keeps this user ID in the order audit history and it will be record=
ed in the <a href=3D"https://wiki.bnc.ca/display/COMPASS/OPO70+Report" rel=
=3D"nofollow">OPO70 report</a>.</li>
 <li><strong style=3D"letter-spacing: 0.0px;">OSS Proxy ID</strong><span st=
yle=3D"letter-spacing: 0.0px;"> - used when validating the order against OS=
S validation rules (</span><strong style=3D"letter-spacing: 0.0px;">includi=
ng mutual fund orders</strong><span style=3D"letter-spacing: 0.0px;">)&nbsp=
;&nbsp;</span></li>
</ul>
<p><br></p>
<div role=3D"region" aria-label=3D"Warning" class=3D"confluence-information=
-macro  confluence-information-macro-warning">
 <p class=3D"title conf-macro-render">Important</p><span role=3D"presentati=
on" class=3D"aui-icon aui-icon-small aui-iconfont-error confluence-informat=
ion-macro-icon"></span>
 <div class=3D"confluence-information-macro-body">
  <p>OSS ID(s) linked to compass X user must have access to <strong>DX serv=
er</strong></p>
 </div>
</div>
<p><br></p>
<p><br></p>
<p><span class=3D"confluence-embedded-file-wrapper confluence-embedded-manu=
al-size"><img class=3D"confluence-embedded-image" draggable=3D"false" heigh=
t=3D"195" src=3D"8ac626dcf0aa980c1ad4aeec57a9d46255f4d01f7e08f536fb00fc56d2=
617958" data-image-src=3D"/download/attachments/1400123149/image2023-1-12_1=
4-6-44.png?version=3D1&amp;modificationDate=3D1673550404363&amp;api=3Dv2" d=
ata-unresolved-comment-count=3D"0" data-linked-resource-id=3D"1400123192" d=
ata-linked-resource-version=3D"1" data-linked-resource-type=3D"attachment" =
data-linked-resource-default-alias=3D"image2023-1-12_14-6-44.png" data-base=
-url=3D"https://wiki.bnc.ca" data-linked-resource-content-type=3D"image/png=
" data-linked-resource-container-id=3D"1400123149" data-linked-resource-con=
tainer-version=3D"7" tabindex=3D"0" alt=3D"" width=3D"468"></span></p>
<p><br></p>
<h1 id=3D"OSSIDsassignmentforCompassXuserswithtradingaccess-CompassXuserset=
up(ver1.6.)">Compass X user set up (ver 1.6.)</h1>
<p>With version 1.6, there is only <strong>one OSS ID field</strong> availa=
ble for setting up a Compass X user.</p>
<p><s>When the user is assigned the user role with trading permission (i.e.=
 advisor, assistant), the OSS ID field becomes mandatory.&nbsp;</s>&nbsp;</=
p>
<div role=3D"region" aria-label=3D"Warning" class=3D"confluence-information=
-macro  confluence-information-macro-warning">
 <p class=3D"title conf-macro-render">Known Issue</p><span role=3D"presenta=
tion" class=3D"aui-icon aui-icon-small aui-iconfont-error confluence-inform=
ation-macro-icon"></span>
 <div class=3D"confluence-information-macro-body">
  <p>Upon introduction of the new access control schema in v1.13 (Nov 2023)=
, the mandatory check of OSS user ID for a user with trading access has bee=
n broken.&nbsp; &nbsp;<a class=3D"external-link" href=3D"https://jira.bnc.c=
a/browse/NWPI-10134" rel=3D"nofollow">NWPI-10134</a></p>
  <p>As of 1.13, users with below 4 user roles have the trading permission.=
</p>
  <ul>
   <li>MO - Manage Orders</li>
   <li>AO - Admin Orders</li>
   <li>MA - Manage All</li>
   <li>AA - Admin All</li>
  </ul>
 </div>
</div>
<p><br></p>
<p><span class=3D"confluence-embedded-file-wrapper confluence-embedded-manu=
al-size"><img class=3D"confluence-embedded-image" draggable=3D"false" heigh=
t=3D"292" src=3D"b92074ae68f25da35435284aa975d4bdce94b7b6de901a3dbd2ee3f3ed=
