data-linked-resource-container-id=3D"1400123149" data-linked-resource-conta=
iner-version=3D"7" tabindex=3D"0" alt=3D"" width=3D"468"></span></p>
<h2 id=3D"OSSIDsassignmentforCompassXuserswithtradingaccess-CreatinganewCom=
passXuser">Creating a new Compass X user</h2>
<p>The OSS ID provided on the user management screen will be populated in <=
strong>both OSS User ID and OSS Proxy ID fields</strong>.</p>
<p><br></p>
<h1 id=3D"OSSIDsassignmentforCompassXuserswithtradingaccess-Migratingtheuse=
rwithtradingaccesstoCompassX">Migrating the user with trading access to Com=
pass X</h1>
<p><span class=3D"confluence-embedded-file-wrapper"><img class=3D"confluenc=
e-embedded-image" draggable=3D"false" src=3D"463a1357b55b78a87c7934a6f82f1a=
6f9e09e0d5d8759fdacaab225c0b017d84" data-image-src=3D"/download/attachments=
